   - Authentication failure scenarios
   - Validation error scenarios
   - Business logic error scenarios (forbidden access)

The implementation follows all the requirements from the task specification, uses proper error translation to HTTP codes, and handles authentication through the provided `usuario_desde_token` function. The tests are structured as requested with the `TestAdsRutas` class and validate all the expected behaviors.
